# EDL-0008: Expand the Relational Data Model for Scheduling and Attendance 
 
- Status: Under review 
- Date: 2026-11-09 
- Decision owners: Geopestejunior and BDeha 
- Related repositories: 
  - Target application repository: [event-volunteer-hub](https://github.com/Community-TOS-Projects/event-volunteer-hub) 

- Related Issue: 
  - [event-volunteer-hub#28](https://github.com/Community-TOS-Projects/event-volunteer-hub/issues/28) 

- Related Pull Request: 
  - [event-volunteer-hub#29](https://github.com/Community-TOS-Projects/event-volunteer-hub/pull/29) 

- Related EDL entries: 
  - EDL-0001: Select MeetHub as the Initial Inherited Codebase 
  - EDL-0006: Establish Event Volunteer Hub Project Identity and Licensing 
